        "If both were derived from a single coordinate length unit u (amu, kJ/mol, SI), the frequency scale implies u~0.56 Angstrom "
        "while the action scale implies u~0.36 Angstrom (factor ~1.5 inconsistency); retained as independent calibrations per instruction.",
